{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nstruct Cand {\n    long long num, den;\n    __int128 err;\n};\n\nstatic inline __int128 Abs128(__int128 v) {\n    return v < 0 ? -v : v;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    long long x, y, n;\n    scanf(\"%lld%lld%lld\", &x, &y, &n);\n\n    if (y <= n) {\n        long long g = __gcd(x, y);\n        printf(\"%lld/%lld\", x / g, y / g);\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    vector<Cand> candidates;\n    if (n > 0) candidates.reserve((size_t)n);\n\n    for (long long i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n        long long j = (long long)((__int128)i * x / y);\n\n        __int128 d1 = Abs128((__int128)i * x - (__int128)j * y);\n        __int128 d2 = Abs128((__int128)i * x - (__int128)(j + 1) * y);\n        if (d1 > d2) ++j;\n\n        __int128 err = Abs128((__int128)i * x - (__int128)j * y);\n        candidates.push_back({j, i, err});\n    }\n\n    if (candidates.empty()) {\n        printf(\"-1/0\");\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    auto best = min_element(candidates.begin(), candidates.end(),\n        [](const Cand& a, const Cand& b) {\n            __int128 lhs = a.err * b.den;\n            __int128 rhs = b.err * a.den;\n            if (lhs != rhs) return lhs < rhs;\n            return a.den < b.den;\n        });\n\n    printf(\"%lld/%lld\", best->num, best->den);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.math.BigInteger;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static long gcd(long a, long b) {\n        while (b != 0) {\n            long t = b;\n            b = a % b;\n            a = t;\n        }\n        return a;\n    }\n\n    static class Cand {\n        long num, den;\n        BigInteger err;\n        Cand(long num, long den, BigInteger err) {\n            this.num = num;\n            this.den = den;\n            this.err = err;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long x = sc.nextLong();\n        long y = sc.nextLong();\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n\n        if (y <= n) {\n            long g = gcd(Math.abs(x), Math.abs(y)); // gcd works with absolute values\n            System.out.printf(\"%d/%d\", x / g, y / g);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        List<Cand> candidates = new ArrayList<>();\n        if (n > 0) {\n            candidates.ensureCapacity((int) n); // but n may be large, but we keep as is\n        }\n\n        for (long i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n            BigInteger bi = BigInteger.valueOf(i);\n            BigInteger bx = BigInteger.valueOf(x);\n            BigInteger by = BigInteger.valueOf(y);\n            BigInteger prod = bi.multiply(bx);\n            BigInteger jBig = prod.divide(by); // floor division toward zero\n            long j = jBig.longValue();\n\n            BigInteger d1 = prod.subtract(jBig.multiply(by)).abs();\n            BigInteger d2 = prod.subtract(jBig.add(BigInteger.ONE).multiply(by)).abs();\n            if (d1.compareTo(d2) > 0) {\n                j++;\n                jBig = jBig.add(BigInteger.ONE);\n            }\n\n            BigInteger err = prod.subtract(jBig.multiply(by)).abs();\n            candidates.add(new Cand(j, i, err));\n        }\n\n        if (candidates.isEmpty()) {\n            System.out.println(\"-1/0\");\n            return;\n        }\n\n        Cand best = Collections.min(candidates, (a, b) -> {\n            BigInteger lhs = a.err.multiply(BigInteger.valueOf(b.den));\n            BigInteger rhs = b.err.multiply(BigInteger.valueOf(a.den));\n            int cmp = lhs.compareTo(rhs);\n            if (cmp != 0) return cmp;\n            return Long.compare(a.den, b.den);\n        });\n\n        System.out.printf(\"%d/%d\", best.num, best.den);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-3.635817120084539e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.2411095415009186e-05, -1.1444026313256472e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.04911408945918083, -0.00034028460504487157, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.005237785633653402, 0.0, 0.0, -0.000714404450263828, -0.002478386741131544, 0.0, -2.4318398573086597e-05, -0.014166857115924358, -0.002476246329024434, -0.004546780604869127, -0.16024106740951538, -7.152555099310121e-07, -5.722029527532868e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.0132738680113107e-05, 0.0, -0.0950431376695633, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.0251946150674485e-05, -0.008873789571225643, 0.0, -0.06196761503815651, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.07891145348548889, -0.0023676715791225433, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.004078879952430725, -3.6954811548639555e-06, -0.038143